+#### Why the local half loads the session list itself
+
+A host switch resets the global session list (`hasLoaded: false`, no records),
+and the phone mounts no global poller: the list is read again only when the
+sessions sheet opens or the connection reconnects. `hooks/useLocalInstanceAttention.ts`
+therefore reads it when the store holds none, so the instance on screen
+publishes its own waiting sessions right after a switch. Without that read the
+drawer showed only the other saved instances' rows until the sheet was opened,
+which reads as one host having more waiting work than it does.
+
